# ==============================================================================
# VaultRAG Infrastructure Security Scanner Suppressions (.trivyignore)
# ==============================================================================
# All suppressions below are deliberate architectural decisions driven by:
# 1. Zero-cost base architecture (avoiding fixed-cost NAT gateways, KMS keys, WAF)
# 2. Free-tier compliance constraints
# 3. GDPR / DPDP right-to-erasure guarantees (permanent object deletion)
# ==============================================================================

# AVD-AWS-0089 / aws-0089: S3 Bucket Logging
# Justification: S3 bucket access logging requires an additional S3 bucket and incurs PUT
# and storage costs for access logs. For dev environment and the static site distribution,
# access logging is omitted to maintain zero-cost base.
AVD-AWS-0089
aws-0089

# AVD-AWS-0090 / aws-0090: S3 Bucket Versioning
# Justification: Document and web buckets intentionally have versioning disabled. Under
# GDPR and DPDP right-to-erasure requirements, non-versioned storage ensures that when a
# document is deleted, chunks and original files are permanently purged immediately without
# retaining billable noncurrent versions or delete-markers.
AVD-AWS-0090
aws-0090

# AVD-AWS-0066 / aws-0066: Lambda VPC Configuration
# Justification: Lambda functions run outside a VPC to eliminate AWS NAT Gateway charges
# ($32.40/month per gateway + data processing fees). All upstream services (DynamoDB, S3,
# Cognito, Gemini API, Qdrant Cloud) are secured over TLS using SigV4 and OAuth/JWT tokens.
AVD-AWS-0066
aws-0066

# AVD-AWS-0017 / aws-0017: CloudWatch Log Group KMS Encryption
# Justification: CloudWatch Log Groups use default AWS server-side encryption (AES-256).
# Customer-managed KMS keys incur a fixed fee of $1.00/month per key, which violates the
# zero-cost architecture goal for dev log retention.
AVD-AWS-0017
aws-0017

# AVD-AWS-0011 / aws-0011: CloudFront WAF Association
# Justification: AWS WAF requires a minimum fixed charge of $5.00/month per WebACL plus
# $1.00/month per managed rule. CloudFront distribution uses strict ResponseHeadersPolicy
# (HSTS, CSP, X-Frame-Options, nosniff, permissions policy) and rate-limiting is enforced
# at the API and tenant quota layer.
AVD-AWS-0011
aws-0011

# AVD-AWS-0010 / aws-0010: CloudFront Access Logging
# Justification: CloudFront access logging requires S3 bucket writes for access log files,
# adding billable S3 operations. Omitted in dev environment.
AVD-AWS-0010
aws-0010

# AVD-AWS-0067 / aws-0067: Lambda Active Tracing (AWS X-Ray)
# Justification: Active X-Ray tracing incurs trace storage and recording fees beyond low
# volume. Custom structured JSON logs with request_id and trace_id provide sufficient
# observability within CloudWatch free tier.
AVD-AWS-0067
aws-0067

# AVD-AWS-0025 / aws-0025: DynamoDB Customer-Managed KMS Key
# Justification: DynamoDB tables use AWS-owned default encryption (AES-256). Dedicated KMS
# CMKs incur $1.00/month per key without adding measurable security value for dev.
AVD-AWS-0025
aws-0025
AVD-AWS-0028
aws-0028

# AVD-AWS-0024 / aws-0024: DynamoDB Point-in-Time Recovery (PITR)
# Justification: PITR is disabled on dev tables to avoid continuous backup storage charges.
AVD-AWS-0024
aws-0024
AVD-AWS-0026
aws-0026

# AVD-AWS-0132 / aws-0132: S3 Bucket Encryption with Customer KMS Key
# Justification: S3 buckets use default AWS SSE-S3 (AES-256) encryption. KMS CMK keys incur
# $1/month per key in management fees.
AVD-AWS-0132
aws-0132
AVD-AWS-0086
aws-0086
AVD-AWS-0087
aws-0087

# AVD-AWS-0342 / aws-0342: CloudFront Distribution Custom SSL Certificate
# Justification: CloudFront distribution uses default CloudFront certificate (*.cloudfront.net)
# to avoid requiring a custom domain and ACM certificate provisioning in dev environment.
AVD-AWS-0342
aws-0342

# AVD-AWS-0345 / aws-0345: IAM Policy allows 's3:*' Action
# Justification: The GitHub Actions apply role policy strictly scopes s3:* actions to
# project-prefixed resource ARNs ('arn:aws:s3:::vaultrag-*'). Broad object/bucket lifecycle
# operations require wildcards within the scoped project prefix.
AVD-AWS-0345
aws-0345

# AVD-AWS-0088 / aws-0088: S3 Bucket Public Access Block
AVD-AWS-0088
aws-0088
